.TH SCHED_GET_PRIORITY_MAX 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
sched_get_priority_max \- returns the maximum priority for the specified scheduling policy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sched.h>
.B int sched_get_priority_max(int policy);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns the maximum priority for the specified scheduling policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sched_get_priority_max (2)
